# Play check 5 (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5; it replaces --play-check 5): three Marines kill a computer's Creep Colony beside its Spawning Pool, whose creep the pool does not keep recedes. A box over the units,
# a right click away from them (the camera placed in the frame of each, as a trigger may move it), the game's steps until 1200; then play_tail.kps's checks. tools/ci.sh wants exit
# code 0 and "0 failures".
mission scenarios/creep_recede
video originals

wait game
wait frames 3
mark start
log start tick creep.tiles units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
camera 1093 1120 &
press world 970 1060 &
release world 1030 1180
log box selected
expect selected == 3
wait tick >= 2
camera 1093 1120 &
rclick world 1216 1088
wait tick >= 1200
# the Creep Colony killed: its creep recedes, the pool's few tiles stay
expect @start.creep.tiles >= 10 and creep.tiles <= 9 and creep.receding == 0
include play_tail.kps
